  "comment": "Sumber: https://www.arduino.cc/en/Tutorial/tonePitchFollower This example shows how to use the tone() command to generate a pitch that follows the values of an analog input. Using a photoresistor your Arduino or Genuino board becomes a simplified light theremin. Contents 1 Hardware Required 2 Rangkaian 3 Code 4 Referensi Hardware Required Arduino or Genuino board 8 ohm speaker photoresistor 4.7K",
